  "description": {
   "en": "\"To protect what's most important to her, this girl harbors both love and hatred within her.\"\n\nHaving lost her parents at a young age, the small but mighty Yatori makes a living by working at a village shrine.\n\nThe Dragon God, a man she looks up to like a father.\nToyokitsu, the son of an emperor who carries the blood of the Dragon God.\n\nAfter meeting these two men, Yatori begins to harbor a grudge inside her body...\n\nA tale of sadness and kindness surrounding the thoughts and grudges of the gods begins now."
  },
